    "Client record status is \"onboarding\", not \"active\". Audit proceeded because build_status is pushed_main and the pipeline System 3 gate keys on build_status; other onboarding clients (tdi-builders, crew-restoration-construction) were audited under the same precedent.",
    "Lighthouse 13.4.0 \"agentic-browsing\" category recorded as agentic_browsing_score (100 on all URLs) but excluded from verdicts.",
    "on_page_lighthouse / on_page_instant_pages MCP tools are not in this MCP build; endpoints /v3/on_page/lighthouse/live/json and /v3/on_page/instant_pages were called directly with for_mobile=false. The live response already contains full audit detail, so no separate full_data call was needed. Total API cost about $0.031.",
